            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This week's collection of supplies requests has begun. Please fill out the application form on a separate sheet of paper for workers in need, stating the required supplies, and put them in the request collection box. Please follow the following format while filling out the form:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7e0aae8615b533d5"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Name: (state your name here)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Required Supplies: (state your required supply here)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Remarks: (state additional details here, if any)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Application Comment: (for mining administration team use only)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3cfc7dff53c01bf6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The mining administration team will collect and review the application forms from all workers on the upcoming Friday, review the applications, and then repost them here. Please check this notice on the following Monday to see if your application has been approved. If the application is approved, the relevant provisions will be delivered to the mining administrative office within five working days. You will be required to present your work ID card to collect the provisions."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b5957b96192ea56c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "(Many request applications for provisions were posted below it haphazardly)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-29490a012bc72e7d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "# 1"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Name: Andre"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Required Supplies: Pickaxe maintenance oil"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Remarks: 3 bottles, cheapest ones are fine, no brand preference."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Application Comment: Approved"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-42809071862aa255"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "# 2"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Name: Orga"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
