              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Required Supplies: Milk"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Remarks: A dozen, best if it's the Moo-Moo brand. If you don't have it, then forget it."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Application Comment: Rejected. Supplies from the top this month don't even have any milk, where would we even find some for you? And you're specifying the brand? Should we get you a cow instead?"
              }
